# Template for the repository-root .dockerignore.
#
# The infrastructure track owns only infra/**, so it cannot create the root
# file. The orchestrator should copy this file to `.dockerignore` at the repo
# root (or merge these lines into an existing one) before building images.
#
# Keeping this list accurate prevents local node_modules, secrets, test output
# and private evidence from entering the build context.

.git
.gitignore
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Secrets and local environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
**/id_ed25519
**/id_rsa

# Build output and caches
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.next
**/.next
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
target
**/target
.cargo
**/.cargo

# Test / tool output and logs
playwright-report
test-results
*.log
**/*.log

# Local private evidence must never be baked into an image
private-evidence
**/private-evidence
evidence-private
**/evidence-private
